{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/808377-how-do-you-connect-with-other-demon-s-after-you-fall","id":808377,"title":"How do you connect with other Demon's after you fall?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-13T19:08:53-08:00","id":808377,"title":"How do you connect with other Demon's after you fall?","content":"since afaik, there is no way to detect a Demon in cover how do Demon's find one another after the fall?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T19:29:02-08:00","id":808385,"title":"","content":"You can always follow the Aether emissions a Demon occasionally gives off. But really, those in the know are likely keeping an eye out for the freshly Fallen. Still, there is a scarcity of certainty in the Business. That newly fallen Demon or recruiter could be an Angel, or Compromised.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T19:31:47-08:00","id":808387,"title":"","content":"How do those in the know keep an eye out? or is this more aether emissions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T20:13:17-08:00","id":808411,"title":"","content":"If I recall from one of the fiction pieces, a Falling Angel generates a huge Aetheric signal. Any Unchained in the area are going to know they have a new (potential) comrade. The question then becomes whether they can located them and earn their trust before they get recycled.<br /> <br /> Also remember that Angels know Demons exist (generally). So they may go investigating some of their suspicions post-Fall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T20:17:12-08:00","id":808415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/808377-how-do-you-connect-with-other-demon-s-after-you-fall#post808377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">since afaik, there is no way to detect a Demon in cover how do Demon's find one another after the fall?</div> </div> </div> </div>Very carefully.<br /> <br /> Plus what everyone else said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T21:03:43-08:00","id":808436,"title":"","content":"I'm going to quote myself since I had a pretty thorough post on a slightly different but definitely related topic. Basically, the question was &quot;if everything in Demon is secret, how does Demon society function&quot;:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kirby Jerusalem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/57341-spoofing-and-aether?p=60530#post60530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Without any justification for them to start knowing each other, it's very, very hard to work this out. Look, I can see people becoming allies. I can also see that they will keep their secrets to themselves, as they aren't keen on compromising their covers, potentially. Either they start asking for any people they imagine could be demons if they are like them, or I cannot conceive how they are going to approach that.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s not easy, but I\u2019d like you to consider a few things:<br /> <br /> 1) The common thing that all demons have in common interest-wise is that they all are keeping their eyes open and their ears on the movements of the God-Machine. It\u2019s a lot easier to notice a pattern and to pick out possible candidates when you have a good idea of what drives the pattern. If regular people can track people down through that - and as Rixx mentioned, they can - other Unchained are going to have an easier time, seeing as they a)have better context for what they\u2019re chasing, b)they\u2019re more resistant to the tools demons have to throw them off the trail and c)have plenty of tools of their own to help out. Quick example: pretty easy to remember that you\u2019ve seen a person around two different instances of Infrastructure when you have a perfect memory. A demon who uses Aetheric Resonance can pick out any demon or angel who spends Essence or Aether, uses a demonic form in whole or in part, etc. Two or more demons each using Aetheric Resonance will make each other as Unchained quite handily.<br /> <br /> 2) The younger a demon is, the harder it has to work to keep it\u2019s head down because most don\u2019t have the skills or the tools to blend in incredibly. I figure most introductions into demon \u201csociety\u201d start early on, simply because they get picked out of the crowd, taught the ropes, invited into/shuffled off into a ring if they want and then left alone to their own devices. I\u2019d imagine this is especially common when an angel\u2019s fall is dramatic and both loyalists and Unchained race to find the newly Fallen.<br /> <br /> Even considering those two points though, you\u2019re correct in that it\u2019s still far from easy. In fact, if a demon is going out of it\u2019s way to make sure it\u2019s not going to be found out, I\u2019m willing to say that in most cases it\u2019s not going to <i>be</i> found out without an <i>enormous</i> amount of effort, patience, and luck. That\u2019s why I believe that...<br /> <br /> 3) Most connection and participation in Unchained \u201csociety\u201d is voluntary. Whether it\u2019s because they want companionship with those who understand what they\u2019re going through, they think that the best way to their goals is with more boots on the ground, or that it\u2019s going to be easier to avoid the God-Machine with multiple people watching out and pooling resources, there are plenty of reasons for a demon to take risks (great and small) to initiate contact, even if it\u2019s to arrange a dead drop or to write a time, a phone number and a name to accept a call with in Arabic on a hotel business card. If all a demon need to stake out a neighborhood or a business as under their protection is a name like Mr. Silver and a phone number, well, a small risk to establish some amount of presence could be just what they need. Which leads straight into...<br /> <br /> In my opinion a lot of reason agencies are both easily available to demons and that they\u2019re treated as a constant security risk is because they\u2019ve taken steps to be easy to found by interested parties. They want members and customers, so while it\u2019s not like you can find them in the yellow pages, by and large you can find a phone number and a <i>nom de enfer</i> for an agency contact with little trouble.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or, put more succinctly: it's almost impossible to find a demon who doesn't want to be found. That said, there are plenty of reasons why demons would <i>want</i> to be found - at least, by the right people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-13T18:22:01-07:00","id":865242,"title":"","content":"Flowers of hell, resonance sencitive actually allows you to identity a demon without spending aether through aether resonance (DtD 184). Though you can also use aetheric resonance without the merit but then need to spend 1 aether per scene you are searching.<br /> <br /> So there is at least one way by the book for a demon to detect another demon while both are in cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-14T01:54:59-07:00","id":865371,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/808377-how-do-you-connect-with-other-demon-s-after-you-fall?p=808387#post808387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How do those in the know keep an eye out? or is this more aether emissions?</div> </div> </div> </div>It also doesn't hurt that apparently when Angels fall things tend to go a little crazy in the area. So you've got some viability in that another Demon could see the fresh one just on the grounds of being in the area during the fall and well when several people in the morgue suddenly stop being dead that's probably a cue to be more on your toes than normal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}